          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "There were born to him seven sons and three daughters.",
      "ko": "그 소생은 남자가 일곱이요 여자가 셋이며",
      "source_text_hash": "beec5e843a94184787037f011cd77b4898ebdf9d5ffaafffb535d25c37bca35a",
      "translation_text_hash": "a4495503290a9c7eb31cd66ab49e78cbfa73957eab234cde4a9d3bed23ac17ee",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
