      "en": "and the Sabeans attacked, and took them away. Yes, they have killed the servants with the edge of the sword, and I alone have escaped to tell you.”",
      "ko": "스바 사람이 갑자기 이르러 그것들을 빼앗고 칼로 종을 죽였나이다 나만 홀로 피한고로 주인께 고하러 왔나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "b523d9c2d8ee880fa6d58dd79fc2058e373e7515356e5ad1797cf9ed9d58e8b6",
      "translation_text_hash": "198dd00c26b0268cab8e28a2cd8faad7e8072f0a91fadefae3c9fd75e77f4db7",
